WEBVTT

00:16.260 --> 00:20.520
<b>RANMA1/2</b>

01:43.100 --> 01:44.180
<b>Whatever.</b>

01:45.100 --> 01:48.850
<b>From now on,
I don't want anything to do with you.</b>

02:02.620 --> 02:03.950
<b>Akane.</b>

02:14.710 --> 02:15.840
<b>She's in shock.</b>

02:15.920 --> 02:17.090
<b>Of course she is.</b>

02:17.170 --> 02:18.420
<b>You scum.</b>

02:18.510 --> 02:19.510
<b>You're the worst.</b>

02:20.260 --> 02:22.260
<b>-Actually. Who are you?
-Huh?</b>

02:22.850 --> 02:24.640
<b>I wondered the same.</b>

02:24.720 --> 02:26.390
<b>Wasn't Ranma the one in a fight?</b>

02:26.470 --> 02:27.850
<b>Where did he run off to?</b>

02:27.930 --> 02:30.400
<b>Forget that for now.</b>

02:31.190 --> 02:32.900
<b>This is more serious.</b>

02:33.480 --> 02:35.780
<b>She's not hurt, which is good.</b>

02:35.860 --> 02:38.530
<b>She may not be hurt,
but her hair met a shear disaster.</b>

02:43.030 --> 02:45.120
<b>Here's what we'll do. Hit me hard.</b>

02:45.950 --> 02:46.950
<b>Hit me too.</b>

02:49.790 --> 02:50.870
<b>Don't hold back.</b>

02:51.370 --> 02:52.920
<b>Give it all you got.</b>

03:02.760 --> 03:04.640
<b>She sure is straightforward.</b>

03:04.720 --> 03:05.720
<b>Yep.</b>

03:06.220 --> 03:11.190
<b>WHO SAYS YOU'RE CUTE</b>

03:24.820 --> 03:25.910
<b>Ouch.</b>

03:27.410 --> 03:29.580
<b><i>I must have twisted my ankle</i>
<i>when I tripped.</i></b>

03:31.370 --> 03:34.000
<b><i>I have to get to the chiropractor.</i></b>

03:39.550 --> 03:41.550
<b><i>She's really angry.</i></b>

03:53.190 --> 03:55.730
<b>Well, then, Akane. Take care.</b>

03:56.230 --> 03:58.400
<b>See you later, Dr. Tofu.</b>

03:58.980 --> 03:59.980
<b>Akane, there you are.</b>

04:01.990 --> 04:03.200
<b>Hey, Kasumi.</b>

04:03.780 --> 04:04.780
<b>OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC</b>

04:04.860 --> 04:06.200
<b>You got in another fight?</b>

04:06.820 --> 04:09.870
<b>Thank you for always taking care
of my little sister, Dr. Tofu.</b>

04:12.040 --> 04:15.710
<b>You see, that is…</b>

04:16.750 --> 04:17.960
<b><i>Dr. Tofu?</i></b>

04:20.380 --> 04:22.630
<b>You're such a tomboy, Akane.</b>

04:28.640 --> 04:30.140
<b><i>If I grow my hair out,</i></b>

04:31.350 --> 04:34.560
<b><i>then maybe, I can be just like Kasumi.</i></b>

04:45.490 --> 04:47.070
<b>H-hey.</b>

04:48.030 --> 04:50.080
<b>You thought I'd be crying a river?</b>

04:50.660 --> 04:51.740
<b>You know…</b>

04:53.120 --> 04:55.290
<b>I'm not angry. Leave me be.</b>

05:02.420 --> 05:03.420
<b>Yum.</b>

05:05.590 --> 05:08.010
<b>Welcome home, Akane--</b>

05:13.270 --> 05:15.520
<b>You can be a little over the top, Kasumi.</b>

05:16.100 --> 05:17.440
<b>But your hair!</b>

05:17.520 --> 05:18.600
<b>It was my--</b>

05:18.690 --> 05:20.440
<b>I was ready for a change.</b>

05:21.150 --> 05:23.150
<b>Kasumi, will you clean it up for me?</b>

05:33.790 --> 05:36.460
<b>If you're that tired
of the way I care about you…</b>

05:37.040 --> 05:38.040
<b>I…</b>

05:40.750 --> 05:42.960
<b>Either way, I owe her an apology.</b>

05:49.090 --> 05:50.090
<b>Akane.</b>

05:53.720 --> 05:55.980
<b>Sorry. Wrong person.</b>

05:56.060 --> 05:57.480
<b>Who are you looking for?</b>

05:59.810 --> 06:01.480
<b>Why the face?</b>

06:02.480 --> 06:03.480
<b>Akane?</b>

06:03.570 --> 06:05.070
<b>Isn't it neat and trim?</b>

06:05.650 --> 06:06.780
<b>So…</b>

06:08.200 --> 06:09.200
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

06:10.160 --> 06:13.030
<b>So you can be genuine.</b>

06:13.530 --> 06:15.160
<b>-Of course--
-Forget it.</b>

06:15.950 --> 06:19.580
<b>I was hoping to cut it short
sometime soon anyway.</b>

06:26.090 --> 06:28.930
<b>Are you okay?
Do you want a piggyback ride?</b>

06:29.010 --> 06:31.470
<b>Don't be kind to me.
You're creeping me out.</b>

06:33.600 --> 06:34.970
<b>Akane.</b>

06:35.060 --> 06:36.970
<b>Hello, Dr. Tofu.</b>

06:38.310 --> 06:40.730
<b>-You cut it short again.
-Yep.</b>

06:40.810 --> 06:42.560
<b><i>Huh? Again?</i></b>

06:45.020 --> 06:47.570
<b>You have a light sprain.</b>

06:48.650 --> 06:50.530
<b>-Dr. Tofu.
-Yes?</b>

06:51.280 --> 06:53.030
<b>Does it look good on me?</b>

06:55.790 --> 06:58.200
<b>Yes, you look very cute.</b>

06:59.000 --> 07:02.210
<b>Besides, the shorter style
suits you better.</b>

07:04.210 --> 07:05.290
<b>Knew you'd say so.</b>

07:17.100 --> 07:18.890
<b>Huh? Oh, no.</b>

07:18.980 --> 07:19.980
<b>Are you in pain?</b>

07:21.060 --> 07:22.230
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

07:22.900 --> 07:23.900
<b>No, I'm sorry.</b>

07:24.400 --> 07:25.520
<b>That's not it.</b>

07:26.020 --> 07:27.650
<b>It just won't stop.</b>

07:38.450 --> 07:39.450
<b>What's going on?</b>

08:03.310 --> 08:04.600
<b>The hell are you doing?</b>

08:13.280 --> 08:15.320
<b>I feel much better
now that I cried it out.</b>

08:17.660 --> 08:18.660
<b>What is it?</b>

08:19.910 --> 08:20.910
<b>Ranma?</b>

08:25.960 --> 08:28.790
<b>Dr. Tofu said you look cute.</b>

08:29.750 --> 08:30.840
<b>Good for you.</b>

08:36.840 --> 08:39.260
<b>It doesn't matter anymore.</b>

08:39.810 --> 08:42.310
<b>Of course it does.</b>

08:42.390 --> 08:45.480
<b>Dr. Tofu has a crush on Kasumi.</b>

08:46.060 --> 08:47.520
<b>It's okay now.</b>

08:48.770 --> 08:50.690
<b>I've come to terms with it.</b>

08:57.620 --> 08:59.120
<b>I haven't said this yet.</b>

09:03.910 --> 09:06.710
<b>That hairstyle looks good on you.</b>

09:09.630 --> 09:11.250
<b>What's that face for?</b>

09:11.340 --> 09:12.340
<b>Did you catch a fever?</b>

09:12.420 --> 09:13.840
<b>You buffoon.</b>

09:14.550 --> 09:17.800
<b>Don't worry about me.
I don't want your sympathy.</b>

09:17.890 --> 09:19.640
<b>That's not what I meant.</b>

09:19.720 --> 09:22.060
<b>You're not cute.
I tried to compliment you.</b>

09:22.140 --> 09:24.680
<b>You're right. I'm not cute.</b>

09:24.770 --> 09:28.060
<b>I'm saying I prefer shorter hair on you.</b>

09:31.690 --> 09:34.280
<b>No, hold on. Wait.</b>

09:35.150 --> 09:38.780
<b>It's not like my preference matters, but…</b>

09:39.410 --> 09:40.580
<b>Ranma.</b>

09:44.410 --> 09:45.450
<b>Thanks.</b>

09:46.330 --> 09:47.540
<b>That makes me happy.</b>

09:50.750 --> 09:53.130
<b>Even if it's a lie.</b>

09:54.380 --> 09:57.970
<b><i>I-is she actually…</i></b>

09:59.590 --> 10:00.600
<b><i>cute?</i></b>

10:04.060 --> 10:05.310
<b>You let your guard down.</b>

10:06.520 --> 10:07.520
<b>Huh?</b>

10:16.320 --> 10:17.700
<b>What the hell was that for?</b>

10:18.400 --> 10:19.780
<b>One point for Akane.</b>

10:19.860 --> 10:22.030
<b>You don't feel so bad now. Do you?</b>

10:22.120 --> 10:23.120
<b>You're not cute!</b>

10:23.200 --> 10:24.870
<b>I don't care.</b>

10:29.460 --> 10:30.830
<b>Get ready, Ranma.</b>

10:31.500 --> 10:33.210
<b>Our duel was interrupted.</b>

10:33.920 --> 10:35.920
<b>But I'll just bust into Tendo Dojo.</b>

10:36.010 --> 10:38.970
<b>I'll show you who is stronger
next time we meet!</b>

10:50.600 --> 10:52.270
<b>ANYTHING GOES
MARTIAL ARTS TENDO DOJO</b>

10:52.360 --> 10:54.820
<b>Tendo Dojo. No mistaking it.</b>

11:04.490 --> 11:05.870
<b>Get up, Ranma.</b>

11:07.330 --> 11:08.540
<b>Fight me.</b>

11:09.370 --> 11:10.870
<b>Ranma.</b>

11:12.120 --> 11:14.210
<b>Wake up already!</b>

11:17.590 --> 11:19.380
<b>Ranma!</b>

11:24.470 --> 11:27.640
<b>I said get up!</b>

11:28.890 --> 11:30.810
<b>QUIET!</b>

11:37.110 --> 11:39.900
<b>What the hell is wrong with you?
It's the dead of night.</b>

11:39.990 --> 11:42.990
<b>Shut your mouth.
Revenge knows no time of day!</b>

11:43.070 --> 11:45.240
<b>Seriously, you better cut it out.</b>

11:45.320 --> 11:47.240
<b>What have I done to deserve this?</b>

11:47.330 --> 11:50.910
<b>Before I thrust you down to hell,
I'll tell you this.</b>

11:51.710 --> 11:57.250
<b>After you stood me up,
I followed you to China.</b>

12:02.630 --> 12:05.970
<b>No. Don't tell me you went to Jusenkyo.</b>

12:08.310 --> 12:09.970
<b>You transform when doused with--</b>

12:10.060 --> 12:11.430
<b>Don't say it.</b>

12:11.520 --> 12:14.150
<b>I having nothing more to say to you!</b>

12:18.020 --> 12:20.110
<b>What's all this commotion about?</b>

12:23.030 --> 12:24.240
<b>Akane.</b>

12:24.860 --> 12:25.870
<b>Are you awake?</b>

12:25.950 --> 12:27.410
<b>Kasumi, it's you.</b>

12:28.450 --> 12:29.910
<b>What if a thief snuck in?</b>

12:30.580 --> 12:31.580
<b>No way.</b>

12:38.670 --> 12:42.170
<b>It is a thief!
Did you see his big backpack?</b>

12:42.260 --> 12:43.630
<b>I'll go teach him a lesson.</b>

12:43.720 --> 12:45.890
<b>No. It's too dangerous.</b>

12:45.970 --> 12:47.260
<b>But…</b>

12:49.390 --> 12:50.390
<b>Take this.</b>

13:01.610 --> 13:03.150
<b>Huh?</b>

13:06.360 --> 13:07.490
<b>Ryoga.</b>

13:08.070 --> 13:09.370
<b>Ryoga?</b>

13:09.450 --> 13:13.200
<b>What a relief. It was only Ranma's friend.</b>

13:23.800 --> 13:25.720
<b>I knew it. He transforms.</b>

13:25.800 --> 13:28.720
<b>ILLEGAL DUMPING PROHIBITED. NO!
RESPECT THE NEIGHBORHOOD!!</b>

13:34.480 --> 13:35.640
<b>Ryoga?</b>

13:36.730 --> 13:39.810
<b><i>Seriously, they're this noisy</i>
<i>in the middle of the night.</i></b>

13:41.900 --> 13:42.900
<b><i>Someone's here.</i></b>

13:43.480 --> 13:45.860
<b>Who are you? Show yourself.</b>

14:00.420 --> 14:02.040
<b>How did it get in here?</b>

14:03.250 --> 14:04.460
<b>Come here.</b>

14:05.590 --> 14:07.930
<b>Come on, I won't hurt you.</b>

14:08.010 --> 14:12.560
<b>You're drenched.
Were you sitting out in the rain?</b>

14:13.220 --> 14:15.350
<b>Oh no, there's a bump.</b>

14:18.060 --> 14:21.520
<b>I get it, Ryoga. I really do.</b>

14:21.610 --> 14:24.110
<b>But you can't ambush me
at the crack of dawn.</b>

14:24.190 --> 14:26.690
<b>I'm a freeloader.
I've already got it rough.</b>

14:28.240 --> 14:30.410
<b>Ranma, where'd you find that dog?</b>

14:30.490 --> 14:34.580
<b>You're the one
carrying a weird pig around.</b>

14:36.500 --> 14:38.040
<b>Why are you all worked up?</b>

14:38.120 --> 14:41.500
<b>Settle down. I'll apply
some medicine on your bump.</b>

14:44.670 --> 14:46.920
<b>What's wrong with it? It's blushing.</b>

14:47.510 --> 14:48.550
<b>As if.</b>

14:48.630 --> 14:50.180
<b>It's one naughty pig.</b>

14:50.840 --> 14:52.090
<b>See that? It's a boy.</b>

14:52.180 --> 14:53.550
<b>You're right.</b>

14:58.350 --> 15:00.770
<b>Say, Ranma, about that dog…</b>

15:01.770 --> 15:04.730
<b><i>Leave it to me.</i>
<i>Your secret's safe with me, Ryoga.</i></b>

15:04.820 --> 15:07.480
<b>Isn't that the Yamada's dog, Beth?</b>

15:07.570 --> 15:08.570
<b>What?</b>

15:11.450 --> 15:13.530
<b>Yeah, I'm positive. Hey, Beth.</b>

15:20.410 --> 15:21.960
<b>Look away for a sec.</b>

15:25.290 --> 15:27.300
<b>-What?
-What is it?</b>

15:27.840 --> 15:29.970
<b>Well that's stupid.</b>

15:30.050 --> 15:31.470
<b>Where are you going?</b>

15:32.050 --> 15:35.890
<b>That dunce Ryoga made me run around
in the rain. I'm gonna take a bath.</b>

15:38.720 --> 15:40.430
<b>Won't you go warm him up?</b>

15:41.730 --> 15:43.310
<b>I gotta bathe with a pig now?</b>

15:44.770 --> 15:46.270
<b>Anyway.</b>

15:46.360 --> 15:48.440
<b>You heard her.</b>

15:48.530 --> 15:50.650
<b>Where the hell is Ryoga?</b>

15:52.660 --> 15:55.030
<b>Pipe down, little pig.</b>

15:55.120 --> 15:57.700
<b>In you go!</b>

16:07.960 --> 16:08.960
<b>Crap.</b>

16:12.760 --> 16:16.680
<b>Ryoga, the pig, you…</b>

16:16.760 --> 16:19.520
<b>I won't forgive you.</b>

16:19.600 --> 16:20.980
<b>Wait, wait, wait!</b>

16:21.060 --> 16:22.140
<b>Ouch.</b>

16:22.230 --> 16:24.650
<b>I knew it. You went to Jusenkyo.</b>

16:24.730 --> 16:27.440
<b>I followed you into China</b>

16:27.520 --> 16:30.900
<b>and wandered across
its very, very vast terrain.</b>

16:31.490 --> 16:33.360
<b><i>I walked for days and days on end.</i></b>

16:34.070 --> 16:35.360
<b>Damn it.</b>

16:35.450 --> 16:39.240
<b>Ranma, that bastard. He bailed on me.</b>

16:40.240 --> 16:42.040
<b><i>And on that fateful day…</i></b>

16:45.290 --> 16:47.460
<b>Wait up, you baldie!</b>

16:55.340 --> 16:59.600
<b>I got kicked down a cliff
by a strange girl and fell into a spring.</b>

17:00.680 --> 17:02.890
<b><i>Before long, my body…</i></b>

17:09.230 --> 17:12.360
<b><i>What ensued next was sheer horror.</i></b>

17:14.070 --> 17:16.950
<b>Sir, that's a delicious-looking pig
you got there.</b>

17:17.030 --> 17:20.450
<b>Good, good. Let's cook it right away.</b>

17:21.330 --> 17:26.040
<b>There's a "Spring of Drowned
Black Piglet" at Jusenkyo.</b>

17:26.120 --> 17:29.750
<b>There is a tragic legend
that 1,200 years ago,</b>

17:29.840 --> 17:32.420
<b>a black piglet drowned in this spring.</b>

17:32.500 --> 17:34.760
<b>Since then, anyone
who falls into this spring</b>

17:34.840 --> 17:38.590
<b>turns into a black piglet. It's cursed.</b>

17:39.140 --> 17:44.220
<b>This piglet could very well be a human
who fell into the cursed spring.</b>

17:45.270 --> 17:47.940
<b>As if, I'm making jokes.</b>

17:51.110 --> 17:51.940
<b>Hot, hot!</b>

17:52.020 --> 17:53.780
<b>-It was a human.
-Hot, hot!</b>

17:53.860 --> 17:55.900
<b>-We can't eat him.
-Hot, hot!</b>

17:58.530 --> 18:00.950
<b>My body became cursed.</b>

18:01.950 --> 18:03.580
<b>And I almost got eaten.</b>

18:04.200 --> 18:06.830
<b>All because you stood me up
on our promise!</b>

18:06.910 --> 18:08.080
<b>Hold on a minute.</b>

18:08.170 --> 18:11.630
<b>A strange girl kicked you off a cliff
and you plunged into the spring.</b>

18:11.710 --> 18:13.000
<b>So what?</b>

18:13.090 --> 18:15.710
<b>Then you're holding your grudge
against the wrong guy.</b>

18:15.800 --> 18:18.130
<b>Go get even on the panda and the woman.</b>

18:25.140 --> 18:26.640
<b>P-PARDON ME!</b>

18:30.440 --> 18:31.860
<b>The panda.</b>

18:34.940 --> 18:39.240
<b>Now I see.
The woman from that day, it was…</b>

18:39.820 --> 18:41.910
<b>you, bastard!</b>

18:41.990 --> 18:43.580
<b>I'll kill you now!</b>

18:43.660 --> 18:45.330
<b>Hold on. Time out!</b>

18:51.460 --> 18:56.590
<b>Anyway, let's calm down
and settle this together, okay?</b>

18:57.510 --> 18:58.840
<b>Ouch!</b>

19:01.550 --> 19:03.260
<b>What is it now?</b>

19:03.350 --> 19:06.430
<b>How dare you exploit my kindness!</b>

19:10.310 --> 19:12.560
<b>Why would you do that to him, Ranma?</b>

19:12.650 --> 19:15.230
<b>Hiding behind a woman now?
You dirty little pig!</b>

19:18.190 --> 19:22.160
<b>Snout-face!
We're gonna talk this out, all right?</b>

19:23.030 --> 19:24.160
<b>I said stop.</b>

19:24.870 --> 19:26.370
<b>Get ahold of yourself.</b>

19:28.950 --> 19:30.290
<b>Poor piggy.</b>

19:30.870 --> 19:33.630
<b>-Let's go.
-Where are you taking him?</b>

19:34.130 --> 19:35.920
<b>-We're going to cuddle in bed.
-Huh?</b>

19:36.000 --> 19:39.630
<b>One sec, but that pig is…</b>

19:39.720 --> 19:42.260
<b>You're a good little piggy.
Don't cry anymore.</b>

19:45.800 --> 19:46.890
<b>What?</b>

19:48.100 --> 19:50.600
<b>Moron. Do as you please!</b>

19:51.600 --> 19:52.900
<b>Huh?</b>

19:54.520 --> 19:58.280
<b><i>Gosh, what is wrong with Ranma?</i></b>

19:58.360 --> 20:01.780
<b><i>What a petty guy. He's jealous of a pig.</i></b>

20:03.030 --> 20:04.530
<b><i>Jealous, huh?</i></b>

20:05.570 --> 20:07.580
<b><i>No way.</i></b>

20:20.170 --> 20:23.970
<b>If you don't want your identity exposed
right this instant, stay still.</b>

20:55.210 --> 20:57.670
<b>N-No.</b>

20:58.170 --> 20:59.630
<b>You got it all wrong--</b>

21:01.670 --> 21:03.970
<b>Blame Ryoga.</b>

21:04.050 --> 21:06.260
<b>Where the hell…</b>

21:06.340 --> 21:09.970
<b>is Ryoga, you animal!</b>

21:13.810 --> 21:17.560
<b>Sneaking into her room at night
is fine and all, but do keep it down.</b>

21:18.060 --> 21:22.150
<b>There are proper steps
in a relationship, Ranma.</b>

21:22.230 --> 21:24.240
<b>It's good, it means you're a healthy boy.</b>

21:24.320 --> 21:25.570
<b>You got it all wrong.</b>

21:25.650 --> 21:27.490
<b>MORE, PLEASE!</b>

21:28.870 --> 21:30.740
<b><i>I can't believe this family.</i></b>

22:56.910 --> 23:01.920
<b>Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter</b>
